    🔢 check 🔤an integer is read🔤 🔢 fine 🔤n🔤 1 10❗️ 7❗️
    👌 check 🔤a boolean is read🔤 👌 fine 🔤flag🔤❗️❗️
    👌 check 🔤one that is false too🔤 ❎ 👌 fine 🔤off🔤❗️❗️❗️
    👌 check 🔤and nothing was wrong🔤 ❎ 🚩 fine❗️❗️❗️
    🔡 check 🔤the problem of a binder with nothing wrong has no errors🔤 📤 🆘 fine❗️❗️ 🔤{"type":"about:blank","title":"Bad Request","status":400,"detail":"The request is not valid"}🔤❗️

    💭 A required field that is not there
