    🔡 check 🔤a text that is absent reads as the empty text🔤 🔡 absent 🔤title🔤 1 20❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔢 check 🔤an integer that is absent reads as the lower bound🔤 🔢 absent 🔤n🔤 3 10❗️ 3❗️
    👌 check 🔤a boolean that is absent reads as false🔤 ❎ 👌 absent 🔤flag🔤❗️❗️❗️
    🔡 check 🔤a member that is null is absent too🔤 🔡 absent 🔤none🔤 1 20❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    👌 check 🔤something was wrong🔤 🚩 absent❗️❗️
    🔡 check 🔤each is told it is required, in the order they were read🔤 ⚠️🐇🔬🔸🧷 absent❗️ 🔤{"title":["is required"],"n":["is required"],"flag":["is required"],"none":["is required"]}🔤❗️
