    💭 The wrong type, from the body
    🌸🐇🔬🔸🧷 🔤{"title":7,"n":"7","real":1.0,"flag":"true","list":[1]}🔤❗️ ➡️ mistyped
    🔡 check 🔤a number where a text was wanted reads as the empty text🔤 🔡 mistyped 🔤title🔤 1 20❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔢 check 🔤a string of digits is not an integer in a body🔤 🔢 mistyped 🔤n🔤 1 10❗️ 1❗️
    🔢 check 🔤nor is a number written with a fraction🔤 🔢 mistyped 🔤real🔤 1 10❗️ 1❗️
    👌 check 🔤nor is the word true a boolean there🔤 ❎ 👌 mistyped 🔤flag🔤❗️❗️❗️
    🔡 check 🔤an array is no text🔤 🔡 mistyped 🔤list🔤 0 20❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤each is told what it must be🔤 ⚠️🐇🔬🔸🧷 mistyped❗️ 🔤{"title":["must be text"],"n":["must be a whole number"],"real":["must be a whole number"],"flag":["must be true or false"],"list":["must be text"]}🔤❗️

    💭 Bounds
    🌸🐇🔬🔸🧷 🔤{"zero":0,"one":1,"five":5,"six":6,"low":-9223372036854775808}🔤❗️ ➡️ bounded
    🔢 check 🔤the lower bound is taken🔤 🔢 bounded 🔤one🔤 1 5❗️ 1❗️
    🔢 check 🔤and the upper🔤 🔢 bounded 🔤five🔤 1 5❗️ 5❗️
    👌 check 🔤neither is wrong🔤 ❎ 🚩 bounded❗️❗️❗️
    🔢 check 🔤one below the lower bound reads as the bound🔤 🔢 bounded 🔤zero🔤 1 5❗️ 1❗️
    🔢 check 🔤and so does one above the upper🔤 🔢 bounded 🔤six🔤 1 5❗️ 1❗️
    🔢 check 🔤and the lowest integer there is🔤 🔢 bounded 🔤low🔤 -5 5❗️ -5❗️
    🔡 check 🔤each is told the bounds🔤 ⚠️🐇🔬🔸🧷 bounded❗️ 🔤{"zero":["must be between 1 and 5"],"six":["must be between 1 and 5"],"low":["must be between -5 and 5"]}🔤❗️

