    🔡 check 🔤a text of the least length is taken🔤 🔡 sized 🔤three🔤 3 5❗️ 🔤abc🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤three characters of eight bytes are three🔤 🔡 sized 🔤signs🔤 3 3❗️ 🔤é🍇é🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤an empty text is taken where none is wanted🔤 🔡 sized 🔤empty🔤 0 5❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    👌 check 🔤none of those is wrong🔤 ❎ 🚩 sized❗️❗️❗️
    🔡 check 🔤a blank text where one is wanted reads as empty🔤 🔡 sized 🔤blank🔤 1 5❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤so does an empty one🔤 🔡 sized 🔤empty🔤 2 5❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤and one that is too short🔤 🔡 sized 🔤two🔤 3 5❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤and one that is too long🔤 🔡 sized 🔤six🔤 1 5❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤and one that is too long by one character though not by its bytes🔤 🔡 sized 🔤signs🔤 1 2❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤and two where one is the most🔤 🔡 sized 🔤two🔤 1 1❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤each is told what is wrong with its length🔤 ⚠️🐇🔬🔸🧷 sized❗️ 🔤{"blank":["must not be empty"],"empty":["must not be empty"],"two":["must be at least 3 characters","must be at most 1 character"],"six":["must be at most 5 characters"],"signs":["must be at most 2 characters"]}🔤❗️

